Z||000007||William Federle||12-16-1999||08:31 AM||||Back when "Fritz" Mondale was running for<BR>president, (with Geraldine Ferraro as the VP<BR>candidate to try to get the female vote) there was a neat political cartoon<BR>that showed a hayseed-looking character leaning up against his Ferraro (Fiero) thinking to himself "Boy! with this little number I bet I'll get all the chicks".||||reg||7
